outbound-stage/v1`).\n- Capacity is reserved under an exclusive stage lock only until stage succeeds (released before `ipc_lan_dial`); orphaned Prepared outboxes are abandoned by exact session/digest/mid binding.\n\n## Scope / verification\n- Independent review green for this Unix LAN slice: raven-core 240, Ash 17×2, raven-node 14, clippy `-D warnings`, fmt, `lan_direct_two_node` smoke, both diff-checks; commit index was exactly 30 files (docs/`raven-security` left unstaged).\n- **Not** claiming the full Windows / iPhone / NAT / Bridge / Offline matrix.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `cargo test -p raven-core -p ash -p raven-node`\n- [x] `cargo clippy -p raven-core -p ash -p raven-node --all-targets -- -D warnings`\n- [x] `cargo fmt --check`\n- [x] `bash node/scripts/lan_direct_two_node.sh`\n- [ ] CI on PR\n- [ ] Optional follow-up: Windows/iPhone/NAT/Bridge/Offline matrix\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)","created_at":"2026-08-15T12:45:53Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T13:41:00Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a4b81c1eae15d944edfa0c17b8fa11ebe469fffc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raven-offline-messenger/RAVEN/pulls/3/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raven-offline-messenger/RAVEN/pulls/3/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raven-offline-messenger/RAVEN/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raven-offline-messenger/RAVEN/issues/3/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raven-offline-messenger/RAVEN/statuses/6d9116664d8eea8303e3e2e2ae70939c624db127","head":{"label":"Raven-offline-messenger:feature/raven-serverless-v1","ref":"feature/raven-serverless-v1","sha":"6d9116664d8eea8303e3e2e2ae70939c624db127","user":{"login":"Raven-offline-messenger","id":264530529,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8RqYQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com